From a8bfc719230a4d927bcd1ee56d933bb9fd8d3959 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 23:07:41 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] gta4l: keep charging in U-Boot, show it, pass ABL's
 command line on

- pmi632_charge: pet the PMI632 charger watchdog every 10 s so charging
  does not stop two minutes into the menu, switch charging back on if it
  was bitten, let a wall charger draw 1.5 A, and draw a battery symbol in
  the top right corner of the rotated screen (bolt while charging, filled
  when full, yellow if charging stopped, nothing without a cable).
- board.c: hand ABL's whole command line to Linux (panel name,
  androidboot.mode, pmos_* and the boot image's own options); set
  prevbl_mode from androidboot.mode.
- qcom-phone.env: boot pmOS after 5 s in the menu; boot straight to Linux
  when ABL was started by a charger (offline charging screen).
- DTS: SM4250 msm-id and the novatek/focaltech touch stubs LinuxLoader
  looks up, as in the kernel DTS, so every revision accepts the DTB.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016AirPAcjr6JyfsKizshE8B
